# Build output (copied from etl-host/target/quarkus-app, reproducible - see README) and
# runtime state (DuckDB cache/scratch/report files, pid files, the sampler's T0 marker).
# Kept locally for inspection but not committed: large, binary, and regenerated by the
# documented reproduction steps in README.md. The measurements themselves - samples.csv,
# events.log, logs/main-run-excerpts.log - ARE committed.
run/quarkus-app/
run/state/
run/app.pid
run/sample.pid
run/t0
run/sigterm_start_ms
run/logs/app.log
run/logs/sample.log
